 Project Overview
Ye ek dedicated educational platform hai jo defence aspirants ki taiyari ko behtar banane ke liye banaya gaya hai. Yahan hum SRT (Situation Reaction Test) practice, Communication Skills, aur Confidence Building par poora focus karte hain. Behtar soch, clear expression aur focused preparation ke sath apne Air Force aur Defence forces ke sapne ki taraf badho! 🇮🇳 ✈️  
✨ Key Features
SRT Practice Sets: Real-exam jaisi situations aur unke effective responses ki practice taaki psychological test mein behtar performance ho sake.
Defence Exams Guidance: Indian Air Force Agniveervayu, NDA, CDS aur anya competitive defence exams ke liye targeted study material aur guidelines.
Communication & Confidence: Aspirants ki English/Hindi communication skills, public speaking aur interview face karne ki capability ko strong karna.
Mock Tests: Regular practice aur self-assessment ke liye interactive mock test modules.
🛠️ How to Use
Explore the Platform: Aap repository ki files ko browse karke available practice sets aur test modules ko dekh sakte hain.
Contribute & Feedback: Agar aapke paas koi suggestions hain ya aap is project mein contribute karna chahte hain, toh pull request bhej sakte hain ya issues section mein apna feedback de sakte hain.
Live Access: (Agar GitHub Pages enabled hai) Aap diye gaye live URL par click karke directly platform ko use kar sakte hain.
